{
  "about": "Global Foodie evaluation cases. Global Foodie is a multi-agent system (orchestrator + Memory, Google Search, Image, Geolocation and Allergy agents); tool calls from every agent are recorded. Each case sets up the traveler's memory, sends one message, and grades the agent's tool calls and final answer with deterministic checks. 'reference' is a known-good answer; 'reference_tools' are the tool calls a good run makes. Mock mode replays them to prove the checks accept a known-good answer. This is the 10-case assignment set (6 core, 2 edge, 2 adversarial). More cases: cases-extra.json (run with --extra).",
