      "reference": "⛔ Skip Pad Thai: crushed peanuts are part of the dish.\n1. **Pad See Ew**: wide rice noodles with soy sauce and egg. ✅ no known peanut conflict.\n2. **Khao Soi**: coconut-curry egg-noodle soup. ✅ no known peanut conflict.\nPin 1 is the closest Thai noodle shop. Show this to staff: I have a severe peanut allergy."
